1
00:00:00,807 --> 00:00:03,437
European style.

2
00:00:03,976 --> 00:00:05,936
(Leonard:)You can recognize people
on Google Earth?

3
00:00:06,104 --> 00:00:10,944
(Howard:)Of course not. I got a buddy of mine
at NORAD to have a spy drone fly over.

4
00:00:11,609 --> 00:00:14,029
(Leonard:)NORAD? You're using military aircraft?

5
00:00:14,195 --> 00:00:17,905
(Howard:)It was already targeted
to poke around a nuclear reactor in Siberia.

6
00:00:18,074 --> 00:00:20,414
(Howard:)I took it an hour out of its way, tops.

7
00:00:22,328 --> 00:00:23,458
(Penny(entering, angry):)Okay, where is he?

8
00:00:23,621 --> 00:00:26,001
Sheldon? I dropped him off
at the comic book store.

9
00:00:26,749 --> 00:00:28,789
(Penny:)Here. Try and go online.

10
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:31,630
- Problem with the Wi-Fi?
- No, just try.

11
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:33,960
Greetings, hamburger-toucher.

12
00:00:35,758 --> 00:00:39,218
(Sheldon(on screen):)You are probably wondering
why you cannot IM with your little friends...

13
00:00:39,387 --> 00:00:42,307
(Sheldon(on screen):)...about how much you
heart various things.

14
00:00:43,057 --> 00:00:45,807
(Sheldon(on screen):)Well, this recorded message
is alerting you...

15
00:00:45,977 --> 00:00:50,017
(Sheldon(on screen):)...that I am putting an end to your
parasitic piggybacking upon our Wi-Fi.

16
00:00:50,189 --> 00:00:52,319
(Sheldon(on screen):)If you want to remedy the situation...

17
00:00:52,483 --> 00:00:56,443
(Sheldon(on screen):)...you can contact the phone company,
set up your own Wi-Fi and pay for it...

18
00:00:56,612 --> 00:01:02,022
(Sheldon(on screen):)...or you may apologize to me.

